        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="agricultural" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Potato haulm cutter, working width 1,8 m, 2-rows. FU is one ha area cutted.;&#10;UUID: e138475f-c6d7-3c0f-99e7-9a9cb7699f12" includedProcesses="The inventory takes into account the diesel fuel consumption and the amount of agricultural machinery and of the shed, which has to be attributed to the haulm cutting. Also taken into consideration is the amount of emissions to the air from combustion and the emission to the soil from tyre abrasion during the work process. The following activities where considered part of the work process: preliminary work at the farm, like attaching the adequate machine to the tractor; transfer to field (with an assumed distance of 1 km); field work (for a parcel of land of 1 ha surface); transfer to farm and concluding work, like uncoupling the machine. The overlapping during the field work is considered. The amount of potato halm cut is not taken into account. Not included are dust other than from combustion and noise." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="agricultural" localName="Potato haulm cutting" localSubCategory="unspecified" name="Potato haulm cutting" subCategory="unspecified" unit="ha"/>
